{{also|takk fyri}}
==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[takk]]'' meaning "[[thanks]]" + ''[[fyrir]]'' meaning "[[for]]". Literally meaning "[[thanks]] [[for]]...".

===Interjection===
'''[[takk]] [[fyrir]]'''

# {{context|with accusative|lang=is}} [[thank you]], [[thanks]]

